            "review_title": "Review at Moc Cafe",
            "review_text": "Long Ethan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThis place is so good !\nApr 2017 • Solo\nIf you want a nice, quiet and rustic place for you short coffee break, Moc Cafe is the place for you. They have very nice Vietnamese Coffee, delicious food and very friendly staffs. But the best thing here is the atmosphere, very calm, green and peaceful.\nAs I heard, they also provide live music in the evening. Just a really really nice place !\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 22, 2017",
